        "Causal padding does not by itself guarantee zero intermediate padding states."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "[8] SciPy paired bootstrap documentation",
      "link": "https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.bootstrap.html",
      "contributions": [
        "Documents paired resampling semantics applicable to matched per-user model outcomes."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "The proposed category-stratified macro bootstrap requires an explicitly implemented aggregation procedure.",
        "User resampling does not capture training-seed variation, candidate-sampling uncertainty or adaptive selection bias."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "[9] On Over-fitting in Model Selection and Subsequent Selection Bias in Performance Evaluation",
      "link": "https://www.jmlr.org/beta/papers/v11/cawley10a.html",
      "contributions": [
        "Explains how optimizing a finite-sample selection criterion can produce selection bias."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Does not quantify the bias for this particular search.",
        "Predeclaring a modest search limits opportunities for overfitting but does not eliminate selection bias."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Official NextItNet implementation",
      "link": "https://github.com/fajieyuan/WSDM2019-nextitnet",
      "contributions": [
        "Documents subsequence construction and differences in training-example counts.",
        "Reinforces the need to control supervision volume when evaluating cropping."
      ],
      "limitations": [
